<!doctype html>
<html lang="ru"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="theme-color" content="#f3f6fb"><title>Канал — Плюс Чат</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="../styles.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="../redesign.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="./channel.css"></head>
<body class="channel-page-body"><main class="channel-page-shell">
<header class="channel-page-topbar"><a class="channel-page-brand" href="../"><span class="channel-page-brand-mark">+</span><span>Плюс<span> Чат</span></span></a><a class="channel-back-link" href="../">← Вернуться в мессенджер</a></header>
<section class="channel-hero"><div class="channel-cover-art"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div class="channel-identity"><div class="channel-avatar" id="channel-avatar">+</div><div class="channel-heading-copy"><p class="channel-eyebrow">ПУБЛИЧНЫЙ КАНАЛ</p><h1 id="channel-title">Загружаем канал…</h1><p id="channel-slug" class="channel-slug"></p><p id="channel-description" class="channel-description"></p></div><div class="channel-follow-wrap"><p id="channel-stats" class="channel-stats"></p><button id="channel-follow" class="channel-follow-button" type="button" hidden>Подписаться</button></div></div></section>
<div class="channel-content-grid"><section class="channel-stream"><div class="channel-section-heading"><div><p class="channel-eyebrow">ОБНОВЛЕНИЯ</p><h2>Публикации</h2></div><span id="channel-post-count" class="channel-count"></span></div>
<form id="channel-publish-form" class="channel-publish-card" hidden><label for="channel-post-body">Новая публикация</label><textarea id="channel-post-body" maxlength="5000" rows="4" placeholder="Расскажите, что нового…"></textarea><div class="channel-publish-footer"><p id="channel-publish-status" role="status"></p><button type="submit">Опубликовать ↑</button></div></form><div id="channel-posts" class="channel-post-list" aria-live="polite"><p class="channel-loading">Подготавливаем ленту канала…</p></div></section>
<aside class="channel-about-card"><p class="channel-eyebrow">О КАНАЛЕ</p><h2>Место для ваших новостей</h2><p>Публикуйте обновления, делитесь идеями и собирайте аудиторию. Новые записи доступны подписчикам в общей ленте Pluschat.</p><div class="channel-about-divider"></div><div class="channel-about-owner"><span class="channel-owner-dot"></span><span>Автор канала</span><strong id="channel-owner">—</strong></div><a href="../" class="channel-open-app">Открыть Плюс Чат →</a></aside></div><p id="channel-page-status" class="channel-page-status" role="status"></p>
</main><script src="./channel.js" defer></script></body></html>